  "description": "There are a very small number of superhumans in the world who possess special powers.\n\nGa-Ae has the ability to recognize these superhumans, and it is through her eyes that she spots Ho-Ban, who is struggling with severe financial hardship. Ho-Ban needed Ga-Ae’s money, and Ga-Ae needed Ho-Ban’s power; with their interests aligned, the two begin working together to track down superhuman criminals.\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
